    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueKrobus",
      "key": "TwoKids_3",
      "field": null,
      "source": "This house has been blessed with two children, now... Does that mean Yoba approves of our unconventional living arrangement?",
      "translation": "Náš dům teď dostal požehnání v podobě dvou dětí... Znamená to, že Yoba schvaluje naše nezvyklé soužití?",
      "sourceSHA256": "6c223ca3448dd2105b3e73a63567bcc4207f534637d2fb323866de52b526d901",
      "translationSHA256": "5b3affe5621e9f9139c5955a6143332479d597a21a05d1f4d1c20260c902b28d",
