    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueKrobus",
      "key": "Good_3",
      "field": null,
      "source": "You started nibbling on me during the night, and mumbling about 'black lick or ish'... what did you mean by that?$3",
      "translation": "V noci mě probudilo tvé okusování a mumlání něčeho jako ‚černá líže kořist‘... co to mělo znamenat?$3",
      "sourceSHA256": "0345be507ce694bc1de77080c2bc4324f626096796742f3ed8857bf309c45246",
      "translationSHA256": "17a1b20affc0e78dff8e6e04889adc639bdf68849a36f6167ec02f6901ad6650",
