      "key": "Good_5",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I was just admiring this lovely house... what a wonderful place.$l",
      "translation": "Právě jsem obdivoval tento krásný dům... je to nádherné místo.$l",
      "sourceSHA256": "55c97510c41814b09e2f5e0ebca0ea642efeb170073bbdfa65061fc0d70a304f",
      "translationSHA256": "342b420a23aba8591043eae302fb845f9fb8d7f30ab44def2e9c74f2e037ee5f",
