    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueKrobus",
      "key": "Neutral_4",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I can't go outside, I can only eat certain food, I need the temperature a certain way... I hope it's not too much of a bother to live with me, @.$s",
      "translation": "Nemohu chodit ven, mohu jíst jen určitá jídla, potřebuji přesně danou teplotu... Doufám, že bydlet se mnou není příliš obtížné, @.$s",
      "sourceSHA256": "ca81aafbbb9a28b2082243e1fd805a1c688c45a964f988eddc4aae0f81f98634",
      "translationSHA256": "9a41b2b26a109c4833ea2d7a8198fa4782fce4ab315d4476ba39506679b61dfe",
