      "key": "Neutral_5",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Welwick says I'm cursed today.$s",
      "translation": "Welwick říká, že jsem dnes prokletý.$s",
      "sourceSHA256": "19e1e69dbb06f184f6606bf602b8ea28f72021c5c6f062c9e9ead4dde1a2ebba",
